# Camera VGA candidate: board27 configuration, camera_pclk capture, DDR core, pixel output.
# Camera first-stage/Gray/mailbox paths need new final-netlist and physical review.
# Bound every user clock-domain pair below to8ns and min0: conservative
# source-to-first-stage/held-bus bounds, NOT a substitute for skew/hold/node audit.
